flowchart TD
    Tokens[Declaration tokens and scoped bindings] --> Spec[Base type and qualifiers]
    Tokens --> Tree[Declarator binding tree]
    Tree --> Prefix[Pointer prefixes and pointer qualifiers]
    Tree --> Direct[Identifier or parenthesized declarator]
    Direct --> Suffix[Array and function suffixes]
    Suffix --> Params[Prototype parameter types and adjustment]
    Spec --> Apply[Apply tree to base type]
    Prefix --> Apply
    Suffix --> Apply
    Apply --> Type[Typed declaration with stable tag identity]
    Type --> Names[Publish typedef or object binding]
    Names --> Init[Parse initializer in declaration order]
    Init --> Sema[Check visibility and conversions]
    Sema --> IR[Typed storage and call signatures]
